              child: const Text(
                'Your reservation tells HPJ there is real customer demand before harvest. Payment is not collected at this stage; HPJ will connect the reservation to ordering as the harvest becomes ready.',
                style: TextStyle(
                  color: Color(0xFF695310),
                  fontSize: 9.5,
                  height: 1.4,
                  fontWeight: FontWeight.w700,
