      body:
          'Healthy soil supports stronger roots, better water retention and more resilient crops. Start with organic matter, sensible drainage, crop rotation and regular observation of soil structure.',
    ),
    _HpjFarmStudyItem(
      category: 'Growing',
      title: 'Crop Planning for Jamaica',
      subtitle: 'What to plant and when.',
      readTime: '4 min read',
      imageUrl:
